   <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-5422 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/02\/68ff730e.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" \/>Krom\u011b toho, \u017ee je ryb\u00ed maso v\u00fdznamnou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed na\u0161eho j\u00eddeln\u00ed\u010dku, je tak\u00e9 d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 pro v\u00fdrobu krmiv pro hospod\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e1 i dom\u00e1c\u00ed zv\u00ed\u0159ata. B\u011bhem procesu jejich v\u00fdroby se ryb\u00ed maso va\u0159\u00ed, lisuje, su\u0161\u00ed a podstupuje celou \u0159adu procedur. Vzhledem k\u00a0tomu, \u017ee to nen\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo\u010dar\u00fd postup, je pot\u0159eba m\u00edt v\u0161echny kroky v\u00fdroby pod kontrolou, a krom\u011b toho je nutn\u00e9 ur\u010dit i kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 parametry kone\u010dn\u00e9ho v\u00fdrobku.<\/p><p>Vstupn\u00ed suroviny jsou v\u0161ak celkem r\u016fznorod\u00e9 (losos, \u0161tika, krevety\u2026), a tak je jejich anal\u00fdza komplikovan\u00e1 a zdlouhav\u00e1. Zpravidla se sleduje obsah proteinu, tuku a vlhkost, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e ka\u017ed\u00fd z\u00a0parametr\u016f se prov\u00e1d\u00ed jinou metodou a vy\u017eaduje speci\u00e1ln\u011b pro\u0161kolen\u00fd person\u00e1l. Jedna anal\u00fdza tak m\u016f\u017ee trvat i n\u011bkolik hodin.<\/p><p>S infra\u010dervenou spektroskopi\u00ed v\u00a0bl\u00edzk\u00e9 oblasti (FT-NIR) lze v\u0161echna tato m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed prov\u00e9st najednou, a to b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika vte\u0159in: v programu TQ Analyst pro v\u00e1s vytvo\u0159\u00edme kalibra\u010dn\u00ed metodu sledovan\u00fdch parametr\u016f a vy u\u017e potom jen m\u011b\u0159\u00edte. FT-NIR spektrometr Antaris II je spolehliv\u00fd, rychl\u00fd a lze pomoc\u00ed n\u011bj analyzovat pevn\u00e9, kapaln\u00e9, pr\u00e1\u0161kov\u00e9 i pastovit\u00e9 vzorky, a d\u00edky sv\u00fdm relativn\u011b mal\u00fdm rozm\u011br\u016fm se vejde do ka\u017ed\u00e9 provozn\u00ed laborato\u0159e.<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-nir-spektroskopie-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ft-nir-spektroskopie-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5035 .elementor-element.elementor-element-34f94d76 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5035 .elementor-element.elementor-element-34f94d76 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5035\" class=\"elementor elementor-5035\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-39bb9cbe elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"39bb9cbe\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5d081f3b\" data-id=\"5d081f3b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-fix-background-loop elementor-element elementor-element-34f94d76 templatemode-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-dyncontel-acfpost